flowchart LR
  Domain[S5 Domain\nuser-defined worlds and applications]
  Surface[S0 Surface\nMir source]
  Core[S1 Core\nelaboration, effects, authority, failures]
  Trace[S2 Trace\nhistory DAG, cuts, save/load]
  Verify[S3 Verify\nchecker, models, proofs, diagnostics]
  Fabric[S4 Projection/Fabric\nper-locus artifacts and communication]
  Boundary[BND-007 Provider/View/FFI\ntyped adapter boundary]
  Host[S6 Host\nOS, browser, engine, network]
  Observe[Typed observation / devtools\nlabelled and redacted]
  Note[Structural map only\nnot an implementation-maturity claim]
  Prism[PrismCascade\nseparate media kernel]
  Wiring[Typed-Effect Wiring Platform\nadapter-operation boundary]

  Domain --> Surface
  Surface --> Core
  Core --> Trace
  Core --> Verify
  Trace --> Verify
  Core --> Fabric
  Trace --> Fabric
  Fabric --> Boundary --> Host
  Fabric --> Observe
  Trace --> Observe
  Note -. explains .-> Fabric
  Prism -. provider / trace-link only .-> Boundary
  Wiring -. adapter-operation boundary .-> Boundary

  classDef canon fill:#dcefe2,stroke:#22543d,color:#102a22
  classDef boundary fill:#eaf2f8,stroke:#2b6c8f,color:#102a3b
  classDef satellite fill:#f6eef8,stroke:#7d3c98,color:#2d113d
  class Domain,Surface,Core,Trace,Verify,Fabric canon
  class Boundary,Host,Observe boundary
  class Prism,Wiring satellite
